    narr:narration """This call records a ruling on how weekly reactions reach people. [Tanya, as team owner, ruled on how the week's reactions reach people](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_1), deciding that [the per-run bundle stays and Fridays add one roll-up of the week — what moved, what is still open](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_2). [Tina asked whether the roll-up replaces the per-run bundle](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_3), and [Tanya held that it does not — the bundle is for the run, the roll-up is for the week](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_4). The call closes with [a daily digest rejected, because most days carry a single run and it would repeat the bundle word for word](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_5).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_1> ;
